WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.600
Ashley J. Thomas: Hi, I'm Mrs. Fox. Thank you for coming to play with me today.

2
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:16.740
Ashley J. Thomas: We're going to watch some short videos together, and after each one, I'll ask you a few questions. There are no right or wrong answers.

3
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.969
Ashley J. Thomas: I just want to know what you think.

4
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.260
Ashley J. Thomas: Oh!

5
00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.909
Ashley J. Thomas: And guess what? Every time we finish a video and you answer my questions, we get a piece of pie.

6
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:38.890
Ashley J. Thomas: See the pie tin down here? It's empty right now. If we fill it all the way up with 6 pieces, we get a whole pie. Let's see if we can do it!

7
00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:50.129
Ashley J. Thomas: Before we start, let me show you two buttons. If you want to see a video again, press the orange one that says Watch Again.

8
00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.700
Ashley J. Thomas: You can watch as many times as you like.

9
00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:58.780
Ashley J. Thomas: When you're finished watching and you're ready for my questions, press the green one that says Next. Ready?

10
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.069
Ashley J. Thomas: Thank you for telling me!

11
00:01:04.209 --> 00:01:06.030
Ashley J. Thomas: Look, we got a piece of pie.

12
00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:11.590
Ashley J. Thomas: Thank you for telling me! That's another piece of pie for us!

13
00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:20.539
Ashley J. Thomas: Nice work! That's another piece of pie! Yum, I love pie! Let's see the next one!

